IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COLSHW.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "COLOP".
01 LS-KIND PIC X(08).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-COL-PARMS LS-KIND.
    EVALUATE LS-KIND
        WHEN "CASE    " PERFORM SHOW-CASE
        WHEN "ACTION  " PERFORM SHOW-ACTION
        WHEN "PROMISE " PERFORM SHOW-PROMISE
        WHEN "ARRANGE " PERFORM SHOW-ARRANGE
        WHEN "HANDOFF " PERFORM SHOW-HND
        WHEN "RECOVER " PERFORM SHOW-RECOVERY
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

SHOW-CASE.
    DISPLAY "rc=" CO-RC
    DISPLAY "case=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-CASE-ID)
    DISPLAY "status=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-STATUS)
    DISPLAY "stage=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-STAGE)
    DISPLAY "strategy=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-STRATEGY)
    DISPLAY "loan=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-LOAN-ID)
    DISPLAY "overdue=" CO-OVERDUE-AMT
    DISPLAY "recovered=" CO-RECOVERED-AMT
    DISPLAY "priority=" CO-PRIORITY
    DISPLAY "msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-MSG).

SHOW-ACTION.
    DISPLAY "rc=" CO-RC
    DISPLAY "action=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-ACTION-ID)
    DISPLAY "status=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-STATUS)
    DISPLAY "msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-MSG).

SHOW-PROMISE.
    DISPLAY "rc=" CO-RC
    DISPLAY "promise=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-PROMISE-ID)
    DISPLAY "status=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-STATUS)
    DISPLAY "msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-MSG).

SHOW-ARRANGE.
    DISPLAY "rc=" CO-RC
    DISPLAY "arrangement=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-ARRANGE-ID)
    DISPLAY "status=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-STATUS)
    DISPLAY "msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-MSG).

SHOW-HND.
    DISPLAY "rc=" CO-RC
    DISPLAY "handoff=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-HANDOFF-ID)
    DISPLAY "status=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-STATUS)
    DISPLAY "msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-MSG).

SHOW-RECOVERY.
    DISPLAY "rc=" CO-RC
    DISPLAY "recovery=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-RECOVERY-ID)
    DISPLAY "txn=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-TXN-ID)
    DISPLAY "status=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-STATUS)
    DISPLAY "principal=" CO-PRINCIPAL
    DISPLAY "interest=" CO-INTEREST
    DISPLAY "recovered=" CO-RECOVERED-AMT
    DISPLAY "remaining=" CO-REMAINING
    DISPLAY "excess=" CO-EXCESS
    DISPLAY "msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(CO-MSG).
